{"term": {"label": "信", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "5A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/wan-zhang-i", "title": "萬章上", "description": "萬章問曰：「舜往于田，號泣于旻天，何為其號泣也？」\n孟子曰：「怨慕也。」\n萬章曰：「父母愛之，喜而不忘；父母惡之，勞而不怨。然則舜怨乎？」\n曰：「長息問於公明高曰：『舜往于田，則吾既得聞命矣；號泣于旻天，于父母，則吾不知也。』公明高曰：『是非爾所知也。』夫公明高以孝子之心，為不若是恝，我竭力耕田，共為子職而已矣，父母之", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "久", "id": "久"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "喜", "id": "喜"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "崩", "id": "崩"}, {"form": "後", "id": "後"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "暴", "id": "暴"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "澤", "id": "澤"}, {"form": "聽", "id": "聽"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}, {"form": "覺", "id": "覺"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 3.42859635585027, "source": "喜", "target": "信"}, {"weight": 1.2885301923539991, "source": "天", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.0653866410397892, "source": "天", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.3871424810221087, "source": "天", "target": "視"}, {"weight": 2.3871424810221087, "source": "天", "target": "聽"}, {"weight": 1.9816773729139443, "source": "天", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 1.2885301923539991, "source": "天", "target": "後"}, {"weight": 1.9816773729139443, "source": "天", "target": "覺"}, {"weight": 3.7162784283020507, "source": "澤", "target": "久"}, {"weight": 2.10684051586795, "source": "澤", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.10684051586795, "source": "久", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 4.121743536410215, "source": "後", "target": "崩"}, {"weight": 4.121743536410215, "source": "後", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 2.10684051586795, "source": "後", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.0231312477421057, "source": "後", "target": "先"}, {"weight": 3.0231312477421057, "source": "後", "target": "覺"}, {"weight": 5.220355825078324, "source": "崩", "target": "從"}, {"weight": 2.512305623976115, "source": "崩", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 3.0231312477421057, "source": "信", "targe